option.LPV_VL_INTENSITY_OVERWORLD.comment = Adjusts the brightness of volumetric colored-light scattering in the Overworld.
option.LPV_VL_INTENSITY_UNDERGROUND    = Underground Strength
option.LPV_VL_INTENSITY_UNDERGROUND.comment = Adjusts the brightness of volumetric colored-light scattering underground/in caves.
option.LPV_VL_INTENSITY_NETHER         = Nether Strength
option.LPV_VL_INTENSITY_NETHER.comment = Adjusts the brightness of volumetric colored-light scattering in the Nether.
option.LPV_VL_INTENSITY_END            = End Strength
